[TITLE]
Slot program fixture (a): steady full-bore head loss vs analytic Manning.
Analytic: Q=60 cfs, D=3 ft (A=7.0686 sf, R=0.75 ft), n=0.013, L=1000 ft
=> Sf = (Q n / (1.486 A R^(2/3)))^2 = 8.091e-3, hf = 8.09 ft.
Gate: H(J0) - H(OF stage) -> 8.09 ft, and INDEPENDENT of FV_SLOT_CELERITY
after R2 (today it is not: the slot absorbs part of the loss).

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         FV
START_DATE           01/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2026
END_TIME             02:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         0.5
FV_SLOT_CELERITY     100
LENGTHENING_STEP     0

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth SurDepth Aponded
J0     100.0 60.0 0 0 0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name Elev Type StageData Gated
OF     100.0 FIXED 115.0 NO

[CONDUITS]
;;Name From To Length N Zin Zout Q0
C1     J0   OF 1000 0.013 0 0 0

[XSECTIONS]
C1     CIRCULAR 3 0 0 0 1

[INFLOWS]
J0     FLOW "" FLOW 1.0 1.0 60.0

[REPORT]
CONTINUITY YES
FLOWSTATS YES
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
